2026-10-31T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-2426) 'the garment handover is timed per leg
 # uuid: 979b7470-3693-59a5-8f0a-bcedefd65fb4
 # tags: rfd:title, rfd:flight-level:l1
 RFD:Discussion  1 RFD
 Serials:VSekaiFabric

2026-10-31T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-2426) 'the timed garment handover, its legs, its load and its checks.
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2426) 'The garment handover is timed leg by leg, so a slow leg shows up where it happens.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2426) 'The round trip from a player's desk to the store's region measured 22 to 28 ms. Which leg of the
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2426) 'handover spends it?
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2426) 'Run the timed handover: replay the recorded pen strokes for 5 minutes and read the 95th and 99th
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2426) 'percentiles of each leg.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2426) 'the garment handover is timed per leg
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2426) 'The store and the backend stay together in one region, and the zones run on a server near the
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2426) 'players (operator, 2026-10-23). The handover is the step that crosses the round trip, and the
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2426) 'rung times it. The measure is per server and per leg, never a count of servers to minimise
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2426) '(operator, 2026-10-23).
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2426) '
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2426) 'The time runs from the worker zone finishing the garment to its ghost drawn in the players'
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2426) 'zone, split by leg: the store commit, the ownership handover, and the fetch by hash. The load is
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2426) 'a replay of recorded pen strokes with the players' recorded head and hand tracks, pauses
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2426) 'included, never scripted motion. It holds for 5 minutes and is judged on the 95th and 99th
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2426) 'percentiles, never on a mean.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2426) '- RFD66606-2287, where this rule lived before the split.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2426) 'Why several servers
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2426) 'Running several servers is expected: a system that tolerates faulty or lying members needs more
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-2426) 'machines to match one machine's reliability, so the measure is per server and per leg.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-2426) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-2426) 'Rules of the run
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-2426) '- A zone confirms a handover only after the store commits it. Writes may group into one commit,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-2426) '  and every waiter waits for that commit.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-2426) '- The zone's tick never waits on the store.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:27Z (RFD66606-2426) '- A player who pauses keeps their session. The replay's pauses must not cause a reconnect.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-2426) '- The report names what stopped the run: tick time, memory, the store commit, or sessions.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-2426) '- The first run on a new host repeats a reference build, so a change of machine is not read as a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:30Z (RFD66606-2426) '  change of code.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-2426) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-2426) 'Checks and controls
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:33Z (RFD66606-2426) 'Checks, each with a control that must fail:
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:34Z (RFD66606-2426) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-2426) '- The legs add up to the measured total. A control that adds a delay to the store commit must
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:36Z (RFD66606-2426) '  show up in that leg and nowhere else.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:37Z (RFD66606-2426) '- No player sees a garment confirmed before its commit. A control that confirms first must be
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:38Z (RFD66606-2426) '  caught.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:39Z (RFD66606-2426) '- The replay is not the bottleneck: the replay host's own load is reported beside the zone's,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:40Z (RFD66606-2426) '  and a control that throttles the replay must be named as the limit.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:41Z (RFD66606-2426) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:42Z (RFD66606-2426) 'Pass limits
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:43Z (RFD66606-2426) 'The pass limits are not set yet: the first sustained run measures them, and the operator sets
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:44Z (RFD66606-2426) 'them from it.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2426  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:45Z (RFD66606-2426) '2351
 # tags: rebac:verbs-from
